# The showcase pass: the Workshop images, taken on Nelim's sanctuary ("Nelims-tribe"), the fixture shared by every mod's
# gallery (PickleTools docs/GALERIE.md, docs/SANCTUAIRE-LIEUX.md). Only 14-publication-shots.feature asks for it, and it is
# skipped in every other pass, so this map is only for that feature:
#   Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -Mod WorkStudio -DepMap wsl-deps.gallery.map -Filter 14-publication-shots.feature
# Run it in English: the Workshop page is English.
# THE PAWN LOOK (TailorMadeWaistlines session, 2026-10-07): the four body and clothes mods below make Nelim drawn the way the owner plays her
# (realistic bodies, visible trousers). Optional for the scene itself, they matter for the pawn. Order is the TMW one: Female Body Variants
# and Female Apparel Variants BEFORE WDI (WDI declares loadAfter on both), then AB, which needs its seed in config/gallery/. The file name
# is the name of that folder. Copied from TailorMadeWaistlines/Tests/Pickle/wsl-deps.gallery.map; renamed from wsl-deps.gallery.map.
tiagocc0.FemaleBodyVariants    3798082132
tiagocc0.FemaleApparelVariants 3799726535
wdi.realistic.bodies           3527486510
ab.vplrf                       2986402536
# Modelled on PickleTools' Tests/Pickle/wsl-deps.gallery.map (studio fixtures, camera, stage decor, coat steps, clear screen),
# plus the two companions this mod's own steps use (click diagnostics, screenshot mode). Replaces wsl-deps.studio.map,
# whose fixture "nelim-zen-meadow-studio" is gone from the gallery (2026-10-06).
nelim.pickletools.clickdiagnostics   path:PickleTools/ClickDiagnostics/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode     path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio   path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.camerazoom         path:PickleTools/CameraZoom/Mod
nelim.pickletools.stagedecor         path:PickleTools/StageDecor/Mod
nelim.pickletools.coatsteps          path:PickleTools/CoatSteps/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen        path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
# The staging steps of image 2 ("stands at ... facing"): ColonistRace.
nelim.pickletools.colonistrace       path:PickleTools/ColonistRace/Mod
